    ('Deut 8:10; Berakhot 21a, 48b — eat_be_satisfied_bless', lambda: the_good_land({'ask': 'eat_be_satisfied_bless'}, DATA), "eat, be satisfied, bless (8:10) — the Torah's one command to bless him: THE GRACE AFTER THE MEAL BY TORAH LAW (Berakhot 21a:3; 20b:16 the after by the Torah, the before by the Sages), the four blessings from the verse cut three ways (48b:5; Tosefta Berakhot 6:1; 48b:6 Rabbi's), 23:25's bread and water beside it (OR by CALL; 48b:7): THE CODE'S HOLE compiled — bless_after_eating_commanded a STATUS on Israel at the chapter's first line"),
