    ('shelf: Sotah 33a — the_grace_in_any_language', lambda: the_good_land({'ask': 'the_grace_in_any_language'}, DATA), "the grace in any language (8:10) — 'bless' in any language that you bless (Sotah 33a:10; Mishnah Sotah 7:1): the one who blesses in another language holds"),
